ISO-10303-21;
/* M191: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET of the 12 LINE curves of a cube outline with NO topology (no EDGE_CURVE/EDGE_LOOP/FACE/SHELL/SOLID); a legal wireframe delivered where a solid was expected (geometry-completeness defect); every item is a valid geometric_select curve so OCC transfers cleanly to a COMPOUND of 12 loose edges — solid==0, face==0; distinct from M051 (non-geometric children, crashes) and M058 (schema mismatch); GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS the model entity — OCC yields a wireframe compound, never a solid root */
HEADER;
